      "writtenOn": "2025-01-30T11:42:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to go/cstyle#Use_of_const:\n\n\u003e Using `const` on local variables is neither encouraged nor discouraged.\n\nFor my education, is there a specific benefit of using `const` here?",
