      "writtenOn": "2025-01-30T14:13:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This may be a \"local variable\" but it is `static` which makes it more like a namespace-scope varriable in some respects. In this case, I strongly recommend using `const` to document that it shall not change after initialization.",
