      "message": "In that case, let\u0027s just remove the `0` and write\n\n    static const std::array\u003cuint8_t, 1024\u003e buffer{};\n\nThere is no reason to use different C++ rules for initializing the first element and for initializing the rest.\n\nOr maybe\n\n    static const uint8_t zeros[1024]{};",
